          "version": 1
        },
        "fields": {
          "notes": "Reader-facing English translation Work first published by Allen Lane / Penguin Press in 1999 and represented by a 2000 Penguin Classics route. Andrew George’s translator and introduction-author credits are preserved as two role-qualified contributed_by claims at Work level. Later Penguin catalog states include a 2016 eBook and an extensively revised 2020 second-edition paperback, each requiring its own bibliographic and textual examination. George’s 2003 specialist critical edition and its translations have a separate Work identity."
        },
